notes.content:
Hey everyone , just in time for the weekend, please find below the content for the Quality of Life Update! 


 Added dynamic tutorials and tooltips to improve onboarding (and settings to reset/disable them);
 Reworked Repair system for equipment and structures (added  a new consumable, the "Repair kit" and a new structure "Repair Totem");
 Equipped items now won't take space in inventory, having their own slots to be assigned to;
 Improved information delivery in Stat panel (added more info regarding: armor rating, cold protection, movement speed, damage dealt, damage resistances);
 Improved information delivery in Compass (added time of day/ weather dial, distance and height indicators for pinned markers, reworked some icons to be more intuitive);
 Added option to toggle automatic gathering from inventory and nearby chests for Fuel when crafting at a Crafting Station. Added also options to prioritize and exclude Fuel Resources;
 Recipes can now be pinned in HUD (up to a max of 4);
 Frequency of storms can now be adjusted in World Settings;
 Minor art improvements (assets polishing);
 Added ping system to allow players to better communicate within the game world;
 It is now possible to give "Follow" and "Wait" commands to all Companion in party through the Interaction Wheel, without needing the Pet Whistle;
 Other minor bug fixes.

Two fixes were added this patch;


In the last patch, changes were made to the building parts to allow them to slightly interesect with other parts, but as a result it made it so people couldn't correctly place things correctly, notably chairs, we have fied this.
 Fixed a bug thanks once again to the Smalland discord and MantaFanta, for finding a bug with grapple + airdash that allowed players to infinitely reach height rapidly
